# Ignore all personal troubleshooting markdown entries & local folders by default
*.md
**/*.md
boot-and-startup/
network-and-ports/
systemd-and-services/
build-and-deploy/
local/
personal/
private/
notes/

# Whitelist public tool docs, templates, generic examples, and skill definition
!README.md
!templates/
!templates/TEMPLATE.md
!examples/
!examples/*.md
!skill/
!skill/**/
!skill/**/*.md
